title: "Satellite Embeddings, Tested on Labels They Never Saw"
abstract: "A preregistered test of AlphaEarth satellite embeddings against Sentinel-2 composites for crop mapping, in California with labels the embedding model saw in training and in France with independent labels, under random and spatial-block cross-validation."
